title: "[Decision tree] ToA for CreateMap<A, B>().ReverseMap()" {shape: text; near: top-center; style: {font-size: 24; bold: true}}
direction: down
q0: "After ReverseMap() only\nForMember Ignore/MapFrom?" {shape: diamond}
m0: "Manual: not a CreateMap<A, B>()\nwithout options\n(reverse-map-options)"
q1: "Forward MapFrom is a path\nof 0 or 2+ members, or casts?" {shape: diamond}
m1: "Manual: unflattens / casts\n(reverse-map-unflattening)"
q2: "B member (not Ignore()d) starts\nwith an A member name?" {shape: diamond}
m2: "Manual: may be unflattened\n(unit test)"
q3: "Per A member:\nReverseMap().ForMember?" {shape: diamond}
f3: "Ignore: left out / MapFrom: X = expr\n(ForMemberMapFrom/reverse-map,\nForMemberIgnore/reverse-map-options)"
q4: "Reversed forward\nMapFrom(s => s.X)?" {shape: diamond}
f4: "X = source.Y\n(ForMemberMapFrom/reverse-map)"
q5: "Same-named member in B?" {shape: diamond}
f5: "X = source.X / nested call\n(reverse-map, reverse-map-nested)"
q6: "Case, GetX or prefix\nin B (MayFlatten)?" {shape: diamond}
m6: "Manual: no member with the same name\n(reverse-map-get-method)"
f6: "left out: AutoMapper leaves it\n(reverse-map: CreationDate)"
q7: "Second map for the\nsame type pair?" {shape: diamond}
m7: "Manual: maps ... twice\n(reverse-map-duplicate)"
f7: "ToA after ToB; Map<A>(b) → b.ToA()\n(_Combined/reverse-map-call)"
q0 -> m0: no
q0 -> q1: yes
q1 -> m1: yes
q1 -> q2: no
q2 -> m2: yes
q2 -> q3: no
q3 -> f3: yes
q3 -> q4: no
q4 -> f4: yes
q4 -> q5: no
q5 -> f5: yes
q5 -> q6: no
q6 -> m6: yes
q6 -> f6: no
f3 -> q7
f4 -> q7
f5 -> q7
f6 -> q7
q7 -> m7: yes
q7 -> f7: no
